{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/053",
  "family": "WAR20"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u17374",
   "en": "I'm glad you've decided to help us. I think there's a way to avoid killing the colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17375",
   "en": "The insecticide we use in the gro-labs contains trace amounts of Tetraclopine, a neuromuscular degenerator.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17376",
   "en": "Dodgy, but it might just work.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17377",
   "en": "My men'll keep everyone safe here. If you're going, it should be soon.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17378",
   "en": "A reduced-capacity concussion grenade might suit our needs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17379",
   "en": "If we must consider it, drop it in a concussion grenade.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17380",
   "en": "We might be able to adapt a concussion grenade to deploy it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17381",
   "en": "Commander, I can make it work using our concussion grenades.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17382",
   "en": "Please try to avoid hurting the colonists. Use the nerve agent I gave you, if you can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17383",
   "en": "Commander Shepard. I'm here to remove your geth problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17384",
   "en": "I suggest you put that weapon down unless you're ready to use it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17385",
   "en": "Sounds good. I'll do what I can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17386",
   "en": "I'm not stopping to ask them to breathe deeply.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17387",
   "en": "You did it. With the Thorian gone, we can start rebuilding for ourselves again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17388",
   "en": "Tell me about the colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17389",
   "en": "Stay bunkered down until I find out what the geth are after.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17390",
   "en": "We established ourselves here four years ago. Growth was steady until the attacks.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17391",
   "en": "Of course. And please remember, if you see my daughter... ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17392",
   "en": "Still, we were making a go of it. It was even starting to feel like home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17393",
   "en": "I guess I thought this would be the start of a new life. I wanted to go where I could feel like I was making a difference.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17394",
   "en": "Instead, everything we built is destroyed. It's very hard not to lose hope.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17395",
   "en": "We will stay out of your way until you clear a path. Good luck.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17396",
   "en": "You tried to do for us. Saved a few. It's more than most would have done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17397",
   "en": "We'll be gone as soon as a transport arrives.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17398",
   "en": "What brought you here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17399",
   "en": "Like a gas grenade!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17400",
   "en": "And we're free of ExoGeni's threats. We're back to being just a little nowhere colony. Thank you, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17401",
   "en": "It'll be tough-going, but we'll make this a home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17402",
   "en": "Some might call us crazy for staying here, but home is where you make it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17403",
   "en": "It's always dangerous to push the frontier, but it's something we have to do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17404",
   "en": "Anyway, thanks. We'll start again. Just not here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17405",
   "en": "It's a shame it had to end like this. We had such potential.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17406",
   "en": "I guess I'll start again somewhere else. I just feel like we are giving up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17407",
   "en": "I can't believe it. Jeong says we'll have all the money we need to keep this place running.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17408",
   "en": "It's because of you, Shepard. I can't thank you enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17409",
   "en": "Ships are already on their way here with supplies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17410",
   "en": "We'll be the biggest human colony yet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17411",
   "en": "Jeong may be corrupt, but he certainly got us a great deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17412",
   "en": "Colony information",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17413",
   "en": "Stay put until I'm back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17414",
   "en": "Why did you come?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17415",
   "en": "Here to help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17416",
   "en": "That's close enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17417",
   "en": "I'm just glad to see a friendly face. I thought we were the only humans left on this planet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17418",
   "en": "You're almost there. They're holed up in the ExoGeni headquarters, just a bit further down the skyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17419",
   "en": "They shouldn't waste time poking around.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17420",
   "en": "We can do a proper accounting of our casualties after the geth are gone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17421",
   "en": "That's my daughter you're talking about! She's still alive. I know it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17422",
   "en": "You see? They're not here to save us. We should just wait for company support before we--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17423",
   "en": "She was working in the ExoGeni building when the attacks came.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17424",
   "en": "Oh, yeah! There are several places she could hide. For a short time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17425",
   "en": "Somewhere at the ExoGeni headquarters. I hope.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17426",
   "en": "I have no idea. We certainly haven't found anything of use.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17427",
   "en": "Something ExoGeni is keen to remind us of.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17428",
   "en": "We need to recoup our expenses. It's nothing personal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17429",
   "en": "I look forward to it, but I don't think it is safe to move while those geth are still out there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17430",
   "en": "I agree. Merging with the other survivors -- wooh. Not a good idea. We'll wait here for ExoGeni reinforcements.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17431",
   "en": "Oh, yeah. We re-purposed that structure to serve as headquarters for ExoGeni. It's mostly offices with a number of light duty R&D labs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17432",
   "en": "ExoGeni is a master at \"re-purposing\" anything and everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17433",
   "en": "The company has to make a profit somehow, Juliana. Feros is a long way from self-sufficient.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17434",
   "en": "Most of us lived closer to the ExoGeni building. Zhu's Hope was mostly used as a port.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17435",
   "en": "When the geth hit, we scattered. Until you told us about the others, we assumed they were killed in the first wave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17436",
   "en": "If we had known they were still alive, we might have attempted to join them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17437",
   "en": "I'll do whatever I can to keep them away from you. But I need some information.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17438",
   "en": "Are we getting close to their base?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17439",
   "en": "Just tell me where I can find them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17440",
   "en": "Where is your daughter, Juliana?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17441",
   "en": "Do you know what the geth are after?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17442",
   "en": "I told Fai Dan you were here. He's anxious to have you join him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17443",
   "en": "What was the building used for?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17444",
   "en": "How did you get split up from the Zhu's Hope colony?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17445",
   "en": "Where are they?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17446",
   "en": "That's war.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17447",
   "en": "Lizbeth's location",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17448",
   "en": "Reason for attack",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17449",
   "en": "I told Fai Dan about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17450",
   "en": "ExoGeni facility",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17452",
   "en": "Thank you. I appreciate that you went out of your way to at least secure us some kind of future.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17453",
   "en": "It's too bad, but I guess it couldn't be helped. Sometimes you have to just walk away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17454",
   "en": "Our biggest challenge has been the lack of resources. There's just so little here of value.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17455",
   "en": "Whatever you are doing, it needs to be done soon.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17456",
   "en": "So what now, Commander?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17457",
   "en": "It's not like it's weapons-grade.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17458",
   "en": "Releasing clouds of nerve gas doesn't seem like a particularly good idea.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17459",
   "en": "Won't I get caught in it, too?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17460",
   "en": "I know you made a deal with Jeong, but there's a better way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17461",
   "en": "Get back, Juliana.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17462",
   "en": "I thought you said they were all dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17463",
   "en": "I said they were \"probably\" all dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17464",
   "en": "They're not dead. But the geth have really pounded them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17465",
   "en": "They're surviving, but the geth really hit them hard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17466",
   "en": "They are surviving despite everything the geth have done to them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17467",
   "en": "They live, though the geth have devastated their colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17468",
   "en": "They're still alive, but the geth hit them pretty hard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17469",
   "en": "We know what that's like. Those damn synthetics are relentless.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17470",
   "en": "Ignore him. The geth are up in the ExoGeni headquarters. Just a bit further along the skyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17471",
   "en": "Those headquarters are private property, soldier. Remove the geth and nothing else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17472",
   "en": "Commander, before you go.... My daughter, Lizbeth. She's missing....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17473",
   "en": "Thank you, Commander. Thank you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17474",
   "en": "No, no, no, no. I don't think that's a good idea. We-- We have no vehicles and the skyway offers little protection.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17475",
   "en": "Like the building we're in now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17476",
   "en": "Listen, our best hope is to sit tight and wait for company reinforcements. They'll come eventually.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17477",
   "en": "The colonists won't let you near the Thorian. They'd die first. They're under its control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17478",
   "en": "There's got to be another way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17479",
   "en": "I think there is. You could safely use a nerve agent to neutralize the colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17480",
   "en": "I think you could safely use a nerve agent to neutralize the colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17481",
   "en": "Excellent. Thank you so much, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17482",
   "en": "If their nervous systems are already weakened, it may act as a paralyzing agent.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17483",
   "en": "Fai Dan and some of the members of Zhu's Hope are still alive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17484",
   "en": "I'm not interested in your company secrets.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17485",
   "en": "I can't stay here. I need to move on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17486",
   "en": "If she's in there, I'll get her out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17487",
   "en": "They're fairly secure now. Maybe you should do that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17488",
   "en": "I need to find out why the geth are after the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17489",
   "en": "I'll deal with the Thorian, then make sure you're safe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17490",
   "en": "What else am I supposed to do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17491",
   "en": "Anything that gets between me and my goal is fair game.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17492",
   "en": "You've got one minute.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17493",
   "en": "What did you have in mind?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17494",
   "en": "Alliance Military.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17495",
   "en": "You're not alone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17496",
   "en": "You thought wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17497",
   "en": "There are others.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17498",
   "en": "I'll find her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17499",
   "en": "You still could.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17500",
   "en": "I do my job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17501",
   "en": "It can't be helped.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17502",
   "en": "Explain quickly.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17503",
   "en": "How can it hurt to try? Please, Commander. These are our friends.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17504",
   "en": "At least take the grenades, so you have the option.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17505",
   "en": "Do the right thing, Commander. Please.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17506",
   "en": "I'm not doing it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17507",
   "en": "I'm so sorry. I thought you were geth, or one of those varren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17508",
   "en": "I was trapped. I tried to get out, but the way was blocked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17509",
   "en": "I-- I was afraid. I wanted to stop the tests, but they threatened me, told me I'd be next.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17510",
   "en": "Good luck with that field.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17511",
   "en": "Hey... As soon as you go, I'm going to find a place to hide.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17512",
   "en": "It's almost time, isn't it? Maybe we can free our friends after all. I have to help them. It's my fault this happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17513",
   "en": "You saved most of the infected. It will take time to recover from the physical effects, but they'll be all right. Thank you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17514",
   "en": "Well, you killed it. At least that's something. But there are so many of us gone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17515",
   "en": "Who are you and what are you doing in here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17516",
   "en": "You stay put. I'll go open some doors.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17517",
   "en": "Why do you think the geth would be interested in the Thorian?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17518",
   "en": "Get her out of here!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17519",
   "en": "Get away from her, you son of a bitch!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17520",
   "en": "Lizbeth!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17521",
   "en": "You won't get away with this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17522",
   "en": "What do you want? You've made your deals. Go ahead. It has nothing to do with us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17523",
   "en": "Thank you so much. Now ExoGeni will pour the money in. We'll be able to rebuild and then some.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17524",
   "en": "I have to get moving.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
